---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | SportsRulesDesk"
  description="Privacy policy for SportsRulesDesk, covering cookies, advertising, and analytics data collection."
  current=""
>
  <div class="wrap page-body">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      SportsRulesDesk may use standard web analytics to understand aggregate traffic
      patterns, such as pages visited and general location at a country or city level.
      We do not require account creation or collect personal information to read articles.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site may display advertising served by third-party networks such as Google
      AdSense. These networks may use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based
      on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized
      advertising through your browser settings or via
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Google's Ads Settings</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      Articles may link to official league websites or other external sources. We are not
      responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@sports.fdaytalk.com">contact@sports.fdaytalk.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
